      "settings": {
        "layout": "split",
        "heading": "Why we started",
        "text": "<p>We noticed that many microfiber towels on the market either scratch the paint or don't absorb water efficiently.</p><p>We founded AquaBladeX to solve that problem, by bringing professional-grade, high-GSM microfiber towels and detailing gear to everyday car lovers.</p><p>We are proudly based and registered in the Netherlands, and we operate across Europe.</p>",
